{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The King’s Thoroughbred: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja23'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 23 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Kuruṅgavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Four-horned Antelope </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>3. Bhojājānīyajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The King’s Thoroughbred: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Api passena semāno, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Though lying on my side </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sallebhi sallalīkato; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>pierced by many arrows, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Seyyova vaḷavā bhojjo, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>the king’s stallion beats a gelding—</span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>yuñja maññeva sārathī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>harness me now, charioteer. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Bhojājānīyajātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
